{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:27:14Z","created_by_operation":"op_7e77fbfb7b3a4d168c9a0188ac545a3b","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_0cbadcc8047e32e3963c954f3489b3da7a3337759c1bc723495f9c02f6481fc3","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"zap-coding-agent/zap-coding-agent@6ab48b82c15e snapshot e16dd8e1241033bc","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_829ed67459678e00cd277f0b829fd9d4494e31e69fc1cb8afb4bc76134fd738d","slc_b9098e58e7d0f380d5f58087b5731f67d9a2000a5227bf1f907ad9fb6d556731","slc_f13438eac7a2af3e010fbe66a4243824fc0621ce748555014f981270f0fe339a"],"source_ids":["src_566f9cc73b1a506ba0c6356333b29a40"],"text":"MCP servers stay pending at startup with only a lightweight mcp_connect stub in context; the server process is spawned and its real tool schemas fetched only when the model calls mcp_connect.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:27:14Z","updated_by_operation":"op_7e77fbfb7b3a4d168c9a0188ac545a3b"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:27:14Z","created_by_operation":"op_7e77fbfb7b3a4d168c9a0188ac545a3b","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_1498106074384681347da2843fe5328e05416eb8f52482ec873661a6ae3a16a3","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=skills-patterns","setting":"zap-coding-agent/zap-coding-agent@6ab48b82c15e snapshot e16dd8e1241033bc","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_306e7494a6e97269dbc34c3904952659607401eed3167bc82734275bdff06f2b","slc_60b97f9546fb9df6a26cfbdf1384739af8b7fbf3c4a08a47f192cac0a5d9214f","slc_7152d791d049ba9a0802a710cda6a55217f9490ca090aa9aa5580f5b85de0b89"],"source_ids":["src_566f9cc73b1a506ba0c6356333b29a40"],"text":"ZAP uses a skill system of markdown files injected only when triggered: always-on skills (e.g. karpathy-guidelines) fire every turn, while triggered skills like rust, git, or security fire on keyword matches in the user's message.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:27:14Z","updated_by_operation":"op_7e77fbfb7b3a4d168c9a0188ac545a3b"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:27:14Z","created_by_operation":"op_7e77fbfb7b3a4d168c9a0188ac545a3b","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_2d46bb3a2ee2ab34a435799916aacc0d0fa234728a33e36364e961b58b1ac404","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"zap-coding-agent/zap-coding-agent@6ab48b82c15e snapshot e16dd8e1241033bc","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_154ab766ad40bda9e3759a4ee2dc7a2a694ed3c3d88892eea565350bde470b48","slc_40a419a3259b793bcba09dfa73ba4b55331072980bb50688a1f07df8acd5b054","slc_6a3a1630881e3756bdc497f8dd398520665087c03ead6e010ea909d31251957c","slc_c6716538351d826f9c0e4c447c01f38c485c2d4cd806dfec71f0dfab988ae441"],"source_ids":["src_566f9cc73b1a506ba0c6356333b29a40"],"text":"Before content is sent to a cloud LLM, a secret scanner checks patterns including API keys, VCS tokens, AWS/GCP credentials, PEM blocks, and JWTs, blocking matches with a redacted warning; every tool call is appended to ~/.zap/audit.jsonl.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:27:14Z","updated_by_operation":"op_7e77fbfb7b3a4d168c9a0188ac545a3b"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:27:14Z","created_by_operation":"op_7e77fbfb7b3a4d168c9a0188ac545a3b","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_31ca53605b9ffa5e977bdd5f2fa1b0d79a8db1e1fa219394e3bc8c90ff791fca","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"zap-coding-agent/zap-coding-agent@6ab48b82c15e snapshot e16dd8e1241033bc","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_234054f4c50082ad1d374f01d6c81651b325ec0b4e00063c96d31a9beefa64a4","slc_844966537ea9db193ff0eb1c36f052c2185de27f5805f68a72461685bb561e0a","slc_f0ca00228dfe43a2df9dba473b9732b20f1c76b8476a9990823d7d6212b2913e","slc_f3c27d79cbead3d510bf2a2278232109e56a9d40cca5064c5e9caac767732ce7"],"source_ids":["src_566f9cc73b1a506ba0c6356333b29a40"],"text":"The AST code index is built at startup with tree-sitter and SQLite, stored at .zap/code.db, supports Rust, Python, TypeScript, JavaScript, Go, and Java, and reindexes edited files before the next LLM turn.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:27:14Z","updated_by_operation":"op_7e77fbfb7b3a4d168c9a0188ac545a3b"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:27:14Z","created_by_operation":"op_7e77fbfb7b3a4d168c9a0188ac545a3b","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_402d827ddfa00ffec9ef659ce16cfce5f421717d11e0af792f5e9ba0ef730ab2","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=evaluation","setting":"zap-coding-agent/zap-coding-agent@6ab48b82c15e snapshot e16dd8e1241033bc","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_604b1cf84500d93892e7d6b05892672da3009b7d0bb71a42fa8c19a591f36a45","slc_6807da892df6a3000e65f57c496fcd487f273a71035fcc486a9991aaceb13a58","slc_a0e160c8e9840f2be6fdd0dbed75651684caf03ff43f878f7a3d8ee0ea9a39f2"],"source_ids":["src_566f9cc73b1a506ba0c6356333b29a40"],"text":"The README reports a token-efficiency comparison claiming ZAP sends task-specific prompts (1,889 vs 1,661 tokens for Spring Boot vs React) versus identical static prompts from Gemini CLI and OpenCode, with methodology in a linked evidence file.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:27:14Z","updated_by_operation":"op_7e77fbfb7b3a4d168c9a0188ac545a3b"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:27:14Z","created_by_operation":"op_7e77fbfb7b3a4d168c9a0188ac545a3b","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_437bc316111fa639905d9ef1f01b02ba11e20b0d58eca3a8f0700980d973dd07","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=skills-patterns","setting":"zap-coding-agent/zap-coding-agent@6ab48b82c15e snapshot e16dd8e1241033bc","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_583464bafb7cbc1f2a93bef6d143e2f70b453b1f712b0333d535f50e5b745ae7","slc_7028eb3700c8cdc9d47355e97643d91ae118005fbbfc65b52abc9a6989de23e5","slc_fa46d99d5e27b880a989d5c01c7aa631c736e5978778cf2e71396fcba892afec"],"source_ids":["src_566f9cc73b1a506ba0c6356333b29a40"],"text":"Skills resolve by priority: project-level .zap/skills/ overrides personal ~/.zap/skills/, which overrides built-in defaults compiled into the binary; same-name custom skills override built-ins.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:27:14Z","updated_by_operation":"op_7e77fbfb7b3a4d168c9a0188ac545a3b"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:27:14Z","created_by_operation":"op_7e77fbfb7b3a4d168c9a0188ac545a3b","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_631282014c8209c51c393c78a6d12ab03ff84cbfb48f1af94e14e7f18fae2e74","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=skills-patterns","setting":"zap-coding-agent/zap-coding-agent@6ab48b82c15e snapshot e16dd8e1241033bc","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1722fe45dc63f0d161512c2c14a991093e7bbbfd736ff112407584e35e87040f"],"source_ids":["src_566f9cc73b1a506ba0c6356333b29a40"],"text":"Slash commands manage skills, including /skill list, show, export, create, and capture, the last of which extracts instructions from the current session into a reusable skill.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:27:14Z","updated_by_operation":"op_7e77fbfb7b3a4d168c9a0188ac545a3b"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:27:14Z","created_by_operation":"op_7e77fbfb7b3a4d168c9a0188ac545a3b","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_8271009ffd6728d4cec7df24567777d0afd05ba58c2218f451f4bab9b8712a4c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"zap-coding-agent/zap-coding-agent@6ab48b82c15e snapshot e16dd8e1241033bc","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_744cfb707eaa66191ef887cbd0435888aa253456e467052dd48d7f5c368afd1c","slc_ac2f3f45e1f4a48d400e1c9fa65095277e1f6785e6061e8b85f709469071f342","slc_d77aa5cb46a964292b0502fa73c97050790597bd6df6c4da21bbb581a09ea58d","slc_db6ba23db67f35e0c46f26c20b2d2dcf7cf71937e885dfa03aab46757f4d85aa"],"source_ids":["src_566f9cc73b1a506ba0c6356333b29a40"],"text":"ZAP has three permission modes — ask (default, prompts before writes and shell), auto, and deny (read-only) — switchable via /permissions, plus a shell sandbox with workdir and container (Docker/Podman, network disabled) modes.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:27:14Z","updated_by_operation":"op_7e77fbfb7b3a4d168c9a0188ac545a3b"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:27:14Z","created_by_operation":"op_7e77fbfb7b3a4d168c9a0188ac545a3b","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_90214120fc7c6c43456a3c439bbafaa64df0858f5b31ea0370771579741c66a8","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"zap-coding-agent/zap-coding-agent@6ab48b82c15e snapshot e16dd8e1241033bc","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5705e868b29f3c05abde0d03a469e19ea85020573613a8de41b9d296ed1b829d","slc_b416fffb798c08ba9014f4429db54fce6da2d72b64b42af6fe509d1e7b8382a7","slc_f0fdd0dcf86ab30a9e22728d83acbef4633ac2b332bd3814ab710961d389b667"],"source_ids":["src_566f9cc73b1a506ba0c6356333b29a40"],"text":"ZAP is a terminal-first, local AI coding agent written in Rust, distributed as a single statically-linked binary with no runtime dependency on Python, Node.js, or Docker.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:27:14Z","updated_by_operation":"op_7e77fbfb7b3a4d168c9a0188ac545a3b"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:27:14Z","created_by_operation":"op_7e77fbfb7b3a4d168c9a0188ac545a3b","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b47aa5719529611de33ff28e629038b70b6ef95b0d773e78ac8e61d6727c0978","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"zap-coding-agent/zap-coding-agent@6ab48b82c15e snapshot e16dd8e1241033bc","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_cf9179042494d2753854378e5eb89f4422eff88d7a8421255f7317523dd940d5"],"source_ids":["src_566f9cc73b1a506ba0c6356333b29a40"],"text":"Index-backed tools include code_map, find_definition, find_references, who_calls, file_imports, where_imported, find_subtypes/supertypes, pack_context, ripple_analysis, get_diagnostics, lsp_definition, and lsp_type_at.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:27:14Z","updated_by_operation":"op_7e77fbfb7b3a4d168c9a0188ac545a3b"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:27:14Z","created_by_operation":"op_7e77fbfb7b3a4d168c9a0188ac545a3b","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_d79d9ee3e5e097013e2922a6f27049a5b22d0170005b88d0d25946628c4af597","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"zap-coding-agent/zap-coding-agent@6ab48b82c15e snapshot e16dd8e1241033bc","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_10be78e546db4dea73e57394a059a9fb9aad1cf052d4d553c1b74622b76b0502","slc_67dbc951202e47a62b220a160d0e319546dccbcede041e91aafc13a527ca93d9"],"source_ids":["src_566f9cc73b1a506ba0c6356333b29a40"],"text":"ZAP maintains four context files (ZAP.md, .zap/understanding.md, .zap/context.md, .zap/session_log.md) updated at defined times and loaded on demand via read_file rather than pre-loaded into context.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:27:14Z","updated_by_operation":"op_7e77fbfb7b3a4d168c9a0188ac545a3b"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:27:14Z","created_by_operation":"op_7e77fbfb7b3a4d168c9a0188ac545a3b","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_db5e90f1f143c0e21a75cfdd920a931e1fc29f0de292f09282d0346c854690d8","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"zap-coding-agent/zap-coding-agent@6ab48b82c15e snapshot e16dd8e1241033bc","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_b288af13b0e148212183ccf511f04733ba68f8c68d4bf7e7baa8766f8a7d2153"],"source_ids":["src_566f9cc73b1a506ba0c6356333b29a40"],"text":"A documented domain map lists modules including agent_core, llm_client, tools with permission_manager and shell_runner, context_manager, code_index, mcp, persistence, skill_manager, and remote session sharing.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:27:14Z","updated_by_operation":"op_7e77fbfb7b3a4d168c9a0188ac545a3b"}
